{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Neon Shot</strong> is a physics-based puzzle game that challenges both your reflexes and your mind. In a glowing digital maze, your goal is to launch a small square by pulling and releasing it with precision \u2014 reaching the target isn\u2019t easy, especially when every shot and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against time, navigate through tricky layouts, and master each level with skill and strategy. With simple controls, deep mechanics, and a sleek neon aesthetic, <strong>Neon Shot</strong> fuses classic arcade spirit with modern physics gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Flick &amp; Launch Mechanics</strong><br>Pull, aim, and release. Simple to play, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Physics-Based Challenges</strong><br>Navigate gravity, friction, ramps, barriers, and more across handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Time-Based Goals</strong><br>Every second matters. Beat levels as fast as you can \u2014 then try to beat your own time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Neon Visuals &amp; Synthwave Vibes</strong><br>Retro-futuristic glow with a dark backdrop and electronic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill + Strategy Focus</strong><br>Some levels limit your shots, others test your creativity. There's more than one solution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Progressive Level Unlocking</strong><br>Complete a level to unlock the next. Difficulty rises as you advance.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910560?t=1754396069","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images